  "details": "Special characters in user-written texts that are part of ASCII are displayed in the website using weird replacements (this includes parenthesis, slashes, etc.) Not only does this render very poorly, it also breaks URLs, making it extra difficult for groups to share resources with their members. This should be fixed and URLs should be automatically converted into links. Throw in a safety confirmation page (you are leaving vrchat.com, etc.) if necessary.",
